      "source": [
        "# Sample analysis with `patientflow`\n",
        "\n",
        "**Question:** at 12:00 on a given day, how many beds will be needed for emergency admissions before 20:00?\n",
        "\n",
        "Demand comes from two sources:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. patients **already in the ED** at 12:00 who will be admitted (predicted with a per-patient classifier, then aggregated);\n",
        "2. patients **yet to arrive** who will arrive and be admitted within the window (predicted from historical arrival rates).\n",
        "\n",
        "The pipeline lives in `analysis.py` at the project root; this notebook walks through it step by step. To regenerate the figures without Jupyter, run `python make_figures.py`."
      ]
    },
